# Earthshaker Dreadmaw {4}{G}{G}, 6/6 Trample: "When this creature enters, draw a card for each other Dinosaur you control." On turn 3
# Bot1 casts it with a Forest and five Moxen. It controls no other Dinosaur: the Dreadmaw is a Dinosaur but not an "other" one, and the
# Pygmy Allosaurus Bot2 cast on turn 2 is a Dinosaur Bot1 does not control, so nothing is drawn (library 17 before and after).
# Turn 5: the Dreadmaw attacks and the Allosaurus (2/2) blocks it; with trample (CR 702.19b) it assigns 2 to the blocker and the other 4
# to Bot2, 20 -> 16, and the Allosaurus dies.

